{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"web_search","id":"exec-9e930c7b-8eb8-411e-88ba-f1d17ae3a81b","query":"\"Space Fortress\" \"1981\" Century gameplay ...","action":{"type":"search","queries":["\"Space Fortress\" \"1981\" Century gameplay","\"Space Fortress\" \"1981\" game mechanics stages"]},"results":[{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.mobygames.com","ref_id":"turn2search0","snippet":"1981 on Arcade ... Space Fortress is a fixed screen space-themed shooting arcade game with three stages. ... Stage one has similar gameplay to Asteroids","title":"Space Fortress (1981) - MobyGames","url":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/233640/space-fortress/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.arcade-history.com","ref_id":"turn2search1","snippet":"Space Fortress © 1981 Century Electronics. ... The loop structure of the original arcade game features a strange programmatic quirk: losing a ship life is","title":"Space Fortress (1981) - Century CVS mod. by Century Electronics, Ltd.","url":"https://www.arcade-history.com/game/2532/space-fortress"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.youtube.com","ref_id":"turn2youtube12","snippet":"# Arcade Longplay - Space Fortress (1981) Century Electronics","title":"Arcade Longplay - Space Fortress (1981) Century Electronics - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z43SQdcM7Nk"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"gamefaqs.gamespot.com","ref_id":"turn2search2","snippet":"Arcade Game: Space Fortress (1981 Century Electronics) ... Space Fortress - [ 1983 - VIC-20 - Gameplay ]","title":"Space Fortress Videos for Arcade Games - GameFAQs","url":"https://gamefaqs.gamespot.com/arcade/216544-space-fortress/videos"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"gamesdb.launchbox-app.com","ref_id":"turn2search3","snippet":"Space Fortress was produced by Century Electronics in 1981. ... Image: Space Fortress - Screenshot - Gameplay (null) - 248x240","title":"Space Fortress - LaunchBox Games Database","url":"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/det