,"snippet":"Century Electronics, Space Fortress sales flyer, 1981, International Arcade Museum, https://flyers.arcade-museum.com/videogames/show/3745.","title":"Space Fortress - Century Electronics (Video Game, 1981) - Italy | The Arcade Flyer Archive","url":"https://flyers.arcade-museum.com/videogames/show/3745"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"gamesdb.launchbox-app.com","ref_id":"turn2search10","snippet":"Image: Illustration of Space Fortress 1981 ... The game is controlled with five buttons: one for shooting and four for aiming, one for each direction.","title":"Space Fortress - LaunchBox Games Database","url":"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/54596-space-fortress"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.mobygames.com","ref_id":"turn2search11","snippet":"Space Fortress (1981 on Arcade) ... * All games by Century Electronics Ltd.","title":"Century Electronics Ltd. - MobyGames","url":"https://www.mobygames.com/company/8203/century-electronics-ltd/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"unglueit-files.s3.amazonaws.com","ref_id":"turn2search14","snippet":"like Donkey Kong; and Space Fortress (1981), which is an Asteroids clone, but ... notable for its use of speech synthesis, telling the operator, “game","title":"Arcade Britannia","url":"https://unglueit-files.s3.amazonaws.com/ebf/9b296840c4804664b82c3a50921d7e49.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"act-r.psy.cmu.edu","ref_id":"turn2search15","snippet":"The Space Fortress game ... (Anderson et al., 1984; Larkin, 1981).","title":"Neuropsychologia 81 (2016) 94–106","url":"https://act-r.psy.cmu.edu/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/1-s2.0-S0028393215302566-main.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search16","snippet":"An official port of Space Zap for the Bally Astrocade was released in 1981 as Space Fortress.","title":"Space Zap","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_Zap"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"mirrors.apple2.org.za","ref_id":"turn2search17","snippet":"Review guidelines: 1) Do not spend too much time describing fiction or setting; 2) Spend most time evaluating strong and weak points of the game","title":"Computer Gaming World Issue 1.1","url":"https://mirrors.apple2.org.za/ftp.apple.asimov.net/documentation/magazines/computer_gaming_world/Computer%20Gaming%20World-1981_1112_issue1.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"files.eric.ed.gov","ref_id":"turn2search18","snippet":"Newtonian dynamics (White, 1981, 1984); and (c) teaching ... perform the Space Fortress Game, which involves concurrent","title":"DOCUMENT RESUME","url":"https://files.eric.ed.gov/fulltext/ED364562.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"pdf.textfiles.com","ref_id":"turn2search19","snippet":"does the game compare with other games of ... All should be available in 1981. ... \"Space Fortress\" mode you defend","title":"I","url":"https://pdf.textfiles.com/zines/CGW/1981_1112_issue1.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search20","snippet":"1981 video game ... It consists of two games which can be played independently or one after the other: Space Fortress, which is a clone","title":"Escape from Arcturus","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Escape_from_Arcturus"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"retrocdn.net","ref_id":"turn2search21","snippet":"instance, featured a Death Star–like space fortress with a giant cannon. ... ated a hole deep enough to destroy the fortress by shooting deep into","title":"from Pong to Pokémon and beyond . . .the story behind the craze that touched","url":"https://retrocdn.net/images/9/9c/UltimateHistoryofVideoGames_Book_US.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search22","snippet":"Space Bugger | — | 1981 | Game-A-Tron | | ... Space Fortress | — | 1981 | Century Electronics | |","title":"List of arcade video games: S","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_arcade_video_games%3A_S"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search23","snippet":"1981 video game ... The player pilots a ship through two heavily defended space fortresses, and the outer space areas between them, to confront the","title":"Zaxxon","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zaxxon"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search24","snippet":"Space Fortress | 2012 | Astrovision | October 1981 | Based on Midway's 1980 arcade shoot 'em up Space Zap ... The Incredible Wizard |","title":"Bally Astrocade","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bally_Astrocade"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search25","snippet":"Space Division | 1981 | Audiogenic ... Space Fortress | 1983 | Romik","title":"List of VIC-20 games","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_VIC-20_games"}]}}
